{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/859920-npc-oneiroi","id":859920,"title":"NPC Oneiroi","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-05T15:18:34-07:00","id":859920,"title":"NPC Oneiroi","content":"Just thought a thread for NPC Oneiroi would be useful.<br /> <br /> Here are a few Oneiroi to start off with.<br /> <br /> Mr. False, is an Incubus who thinks he's a True Fae. A Changeling named Hank was having reocurring flashback dreams to his time in Arcadia, which never seemed to be sharp enough to provide the answers Hank wanted, so he intenfied his dream, too much, and when his dream ended.<br /> <br /> When he saw his Keep, he panicked and scoured his dream, but it wasn't it was just a dream copy of his Keeper, which survived the end of his dream.<br /> <br /> Stephanie, Cambion, occupation Lifeguard, not needing to breath is a useful trait for a lifeguard, a gift Stephanie has used to become the top lifeguard in her area. Steph has an on going deal with the local Changeling Freehold, using her unique abilities on their behalf in exchange for a steady supply of Glamour.<br /> <br /> Farmer Grant, a Sandman who made his a deal with the local Freehold, leave that Dream Bastions he protected along, and he'd use his gardening skills to grow a crop of Hedge Fruit yearly.<br /> <br /> Also something interesting to note all Oneiroi can do Sealings, as I believe all Fae except Fetches can do Sealings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-05T15:36:43-07:00","id":859932,"title":"","content":"Call them Dream Bastions, to avoid confusion. Changelings muck around in dreams(Dream Bastions), not souls(Oneiroi).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-07T05:37:23-07:00","id":860984,"title":"","content":"I was refering to the Hobgoblins collectively called Oneiroi, Cambions, Incubui, Succubi, Sandman, those Mantis things, Baku for example.<br /> <br /> And I didn't name them Oneiroi the playtest document did. <br /> <br /> Calling them Dream Bastions will confuse them with actual Dream Bastions. What's the final name for them?<br /> <br /> Maybe for now we could call them Dreamlings?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-07T06:07:29-07:00","id":860997,"title":"","content":"Some observations about Cambions. Cambions breeding with any mortals should breed true.<br /> <br /> Cambions are part mortal, like Changelings, so they're more like Changelings, minus the kidnapping, then any other group.<br /> <br /> They're good at stealing glamour, but aside from food and Sealings, they don't seem to be able to use if any other way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}